### Step-by-Step Code Walkthrough: Sum of Digits

A classic problem is extracting and summing the digits of an integer:

```java
public class DigitSum {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int n = 345;
        int sum = 0;

        while (n > 0) {
            int digit = n % 10; // Extract last digit
            sum += digit;       // Add to sum
            n /= 10;            // Discard last digit
        }

        System.out.println("Sum of digits: " + sum); // Outputs: 12
    }
}
```

#### Iteration Trace:
1. `n = 345`: `digit = 5`, `sum = 5`, `n = 34`.
2. `n = 34`: `digit = 4`, `sum = 9`, `n = 3`.
3. `n = 3`: `digit = 3`, `sum = 12`, `n = 0`. Loop terminates.

